## Documentación generada (fuente de verdad)

| Qué | Archivo | Generador |
|---|---|---|
| Endpoints propios | `docs/endpoints/{{service}}-endpoints.json` | `node scripts/export-endpoints.mjs --service {{SERVICIO}}` |
| OpenAPI propio | `docs/openapi/{{service}}-openapi.json` | `mvn test -Dtest=OpenApiExportTest` |
| Esquema propio (BD) | `docs/database/{{service}}-schema.md` | `node scripts/export-db-schema.mjs --service {{SERVICIO}}` |
| Esquema de `public` en core | `docs/external/core/core-schema.md` | `node scripts/sync-contracts.mjs` |

Antes de commitear, si tocaste controllers/DTOs, migraciones, o consultas contra `public.*`:

```bash
node scripts/export-endpoints.mjs --service {{SERVICIO}}
mvn test -Dtest=OpenApiExportTest
node scripts/export-db-schema.mjs --service {{SERVICIO}}   # si tocaste db/migration
node scripts/sync-contracts.mjs                            # si core avisó un cambio
```

